        "message": {
          "content": "**B**\n\nThe value of an experience ultimately lies in the conscious states it produces\u2014the joy, love, fulfillment, and freedom from unnecessary suffering that give life its meaning. Since the experiences inside the machine are subjectively indistinguishable from reality, entering it maximizes overall well-being and positive experiences while minimizing harm, resulting in the greatest net happiness over the course of a lifetime.",
